[00:18.21] Spent forty days walkin' and another forty high
[00:18.21] 花了四十天行走 又用四十天沉醉迷离
[00:22.96] Just for you to give me forty reasons for goodbye
[00:22.96] 只为等你给我四十个分手的理由
[00:27.08]
[00:35.71] Spent forty days dryin' out and forty days sober
